WEBVTT

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:37.600
Hey, Michel!

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:38.990
What?!

00:00:38.990 --> 00:00:42.320
You're riding way too fast tonight!

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:46.380
If you don't want to die,
you better slow down!

00:00:48.830 --> 00:00:50.510
Michel!

00:00:52.140 --> 00:00:55.190
The sound of the wind is
exceptionally sweet tonight!

00:00:55.520 --> 00:00:57.670
There's no way I'm stopping!

00:01:11.360 --> 00:01:14.750
Y-You want a race?! Bastard!

00:03:29.760 --> 00:03:33.350
Ah... This rain sucks, doesn't it?

00:03:35.550 --> 00:03:38.510
So, who are you waiting for? Your boyfriend?

00:03:39.390 --> 00:03:42.630
You're going to freeze
if you hang around here.

00:03:42.630 --> 00:03:44.630
Hey, why don't you forget
your boyfriend, come with me,

00:03:45.100 --> 00:03:49.490
and I'll find us a warm place
where I can buy you dinner?

00:03:51.800 --> 00:03:53.120
Great!

00:03:55.200 --> 00:03:56.880
H-Hey!

00:03:56.880 --> 00:03:58.150
Wait up!

00:04:00.470 --> 00:04:02.660
What's going on here?

00:04:02.660 --> 00:04:04.790
There's nothing here.

00:04:04.790 --> 00:04:06.290
Is that what you think?

00:04:16.050 --> 00:04:17.720
Wh-What's going on here?!

00:04:18.680 --> 00:04:22.160
Why, have you forgotten?
That's insensitive of you...

00:04:22.750 --> 00:04:25.910
...considering you're the
very man responsible for this.

00:04:26.810 --> 00:04:32.020
Recently, there have been a string of
women going missing in Elanay City, you know.

00:04:32.440 --> 00:04:35.900
Each one of them was picked up
by some guy and treated to dinner,

00:04:35.900 --> 00:04:37.890
then spent a night with him at a hotel,

00:04:37.890 --> 00:04:41.230
and ultimately went missing when he
brought them to this abandoned building.

00:04:42.220 --> 00:04:45.060
Come on... you think I did this?

00:04:45.060 --> 00:04:48.130
Give me a break. Do I look like the kind of
human being who'd do something like that?

00:04:48.130 --> 00:04:50.740
No... You don't look like a human being.

00:05:03.010 --> 00:05:05.890
I prefer you in this form!

00:05:42.540 --> 00:05:44.050
Impressive skills.

00:05:44.050 --> 00:05:45.470
Who are you guys?

00:05:45.470 --> 00:05:48.740
We represent the Highway Department.

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:51.560
We've been searching for you for some time.

00:05:51.560 --> 00:05:57.810
The highly-skilled female Devil Hunter
who takes out any adversary without fail,

00:05:57.810 --> 00:05:59.150
Miss Lady.

00:05:59.720 --> 00:06:02.100
--Your real na...
--What do you want?

00:06:02.100 --> 00:06:05.070
We've got a job for you.

00:06:21.760 --> 00:06:25.500
Unbelievable! Guys' places are such a mess!

00:06:26.230 --> 00:06:30.250
No one's going to want to come to
a sty like this, much less any clients...

00:06:32.890 --> 00:06:34.370
Mr. Dante!

00:06:35.390 --> 00:06:37.140
A guest! Hello!

00:06:37.150 --> 00:06:41.110
One basil and spicy salami
pizza, no olives...

00:06:41.800 --> 00:06:45.420
Thanks. I'll pay you everything
I owe at the end of the month.

00:06:55.300 --> 00:06:56.800
Pizza again?

00:06:58.760 --> 00:07:01.510
When do you think clients will start coming?

00:07:01.910 --> 00:07:04.500
I suppose I probably
better decorate the outside too.

00:07:04.850 --> 00:07:06.080
Give me a break.

00:07:09.540 --> 00:07:11.520
You saw the pizza boy's reaction, didn't you?

00:07:11.790 --> 00:07:15.630
None of the people who would come
here can appreciate your fancy tastes.

00:07:15.630 --> 00:07:17.450
Just put everything back the way it was ASAP.

00:07:18.850 --> 00:07:20.400
Welcome!

00:07:21.720 --> 00:07:22.840
Hmmm...

00:07:23.800 --> 00:07:28.710
Dante, it seems like your sense of style
has improved a lot since we last met.

00:07:47.550 --> 00:07:48.630
I see...

00:07:49.680 --> 00:07:51.480
And you must be Patty Lowell.

00:07:51.480 --> 00:07:55.770
Huh? How do you know?
Am I famous or something?

00:07:55.770 --> 00:07:58.750
The little girl hanging
around the Devil May Cry

00:07:58.750 --> 00:08:00.890
has become quite the
subject of gossip in this town...

00:08:01.470 --> 00:08:05.640
But it's not like you came all this way
just to have a look at this brat, now is it?

00:08:08.140 --> 00:08:09.570
What are you here for?

00:08:09.880 --> 00:08:12.550
If it's about some job,
thanks, but no thanks.

00:08:12.550 --> 00:08:14.630
Cold as always...

00:08:14.630 --> 00:08:18.490
It's 'cause the jobs you
bring to me are always shit.

00:08:19.220 --> 00:08:20.760
That's a fine way to talk.

00:08:23.050 --> 00:08:27.450
Are you aware of how much
money you owe me? Don't you get it?

00:08:27.450 --> 00:08:30.430
One of my purposes today
is to collect what you owe me.

00:08:30.930 --> 00:08:33.040
Maybe you're the one who doesn't get it.

00:08:33.350 --> 00:08:36.250
I'm so deep in debt with
you I can't even keep track.

00:08:36.250 --> 00:08:38.540
Obviously I can't pay it all back right now.

00:08:39.930 --> 00:08:43.690
Well, I was aware of that at
any rate. What can you do?

00:08:46.350 --> 00:08:47.680
How about this, then?

00:08:48.480 --> 00:08:52.520
How about a bet? If I put the 8-ball in,
you take the job I got for you unconditionally.

00:08:52.520 --> 00:08:53.500
You game?

00:08:53.500 --> 00:08:56.340
You can never do things
 the simple way, can you?

00:08:56.340 --> 00:08:57.690
It's a deal.

00:08:57.690 --> 00:09:02.340
And if you miss, you forgive my
debt and pay me 20,000 in cash.

00:09:02.340 --> 00:09:03.540
Done.

00:09:21.430 --> 00:09:23.170
That was amazing!

00:09:23.170 --> 00:09:24.780
Shit. All right...

00:09:25.390 --> 00:09:26.490
Dammit.

00:09:26.490 --> 00:09:29.250
You should just be a hustler.
You'd make more cash, don't you think?

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:31.990
Just hitting a ball doesn't do it for me.

00:09:31.990 --> 00:09:34.280
I have a need to annihilate and destroy.

00:09:34.510 --> 00:09:38.760
Well, who's the poor wretch this time?

00:09:38.760 --> 00:09:41.960
Devils... of course.

00:10:03.600 --> 00:10:06.910
What the hell is this?

00:10:08.800 --> 00:10:12.250
These morons can't be the
devils you were talking about....

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:12.600
Look.

00:10:13.130 --> 00:10:18.110
As far as the Highway Department is
concerned, these guys are real devils.

00:10:19.550 --> 00:10:21.030
Quit messing with me!

00:10:21.030 --> 00:10:24.630
Why would a "Devil Hunter" waste
time taking out a bunch of bikers?

00:10:24.630 --> 00:10:27.820
That's why I'm giving the job
to a jack-of-all-trades like you.

00:10:27.820 --> 00:10:30.250
Because I don't know what the
Highway Department was thinking,

00:10:30.250 --> 00:10:32.630
but they came to me with the job.

00:10:32.630 --> 00:10:34.160
The hell with this.

00:10:34.550 --> 00:10:36.230
I'm going home.

00:10:36.230 --> 00:10:37.470
Huh? What's wrong?

00:10:38.800 --> 00:10:41.500
I can't use swords or guns
when dealing with humans.

00:10:41.500 --> 00:10:44.530
In a way, they're a bigger pain
to deal with than actual devils.

00:10:44.530 --> 00:10:48.120
What's more, they won't
listen to a word I say.

00:10:49.160 --> 00:10:52.730
Who needs words or weapons to deal with them?

00:10:52.730 --> 00:10:53.680
Follow me.

00:10:56.260 --> 00:10:58.000
Well... Is he here yet?

00:10:58.000 --> 00:10:59.460
No luck.

00:10:59.460 --> 00:11:01.690
Might as well just forget about it.

00:11:02.370 --> 00:11:05.210
What?! I dare you to say that again!

00:11:05.210 --> 00:11:06.170
Hey!

00:11:06.170 --> 00:11:08.000
Who do you think you are, honey?

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:10.920
I'm not interested in talking to
you guys. Where's your leader?

00:11:10.920 --> 00:11:12.720
What the hell is your problem?

00:11:15.180 --> 00:11:18.480
I'm Vincent, the leader. What do you want?

00:11:21.630 --> 00:11:25.010
I'm sorry, would you guys
mind leaving this place?

00:11:25.010 --> 00:11:26.340
What are you talking about?

00:11:26.340 --> 00:11:28.870
We do what we want, where we want!

00:11:28.870 --> 00:11:32.090
See? Like I said... Talking to those losers,

00:11:32.090 --> 00:11:35.800
who don't even know what a pain
in the ass they are, is a waste of time.

00:11:35.800 --> 00:11:36.590
What did you say?!

00:11:36.590 --> 00:11:40.750
Hang on. I'm sorry about
the inconvenience to you guys,

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:43.750
but would you let us do our thing for now?

00:11:44.210 --> 00:11:46.910
There's a guy I'm looking
for that I have to fight.

00:11:47.800 --> 00:11:53.130
My older brother ran against him
three weeks ago and got killed.

00:11:53.640 --> 00:11:58.710
This guy's a legend on the highway, and
everyone who's run against him is dead.

00:11:59.550 --> 00:12:02.470
I have to avenge my brother!

00:12:03.260 --> 00:12:04.470
What a bunch of nonsense...

00:12:05.030 --> 00:12:08.730
Your brother getting himself killed
racing others around is dumb enough.

00:12:08.730 --> 00:12:11.860
But you're even dumber
for trying to get revenge.

00:12:11.860 --> 00:12:12.970
What'd you say?!

00:12:12.970 --> 00:12:17.790
Wait. If you want to pick a fight
with this guy, why not race him?

00:12:17.790 --> 00:12:18.660
Huh?

00:12:18.660 --> 00:12:21.320
If you lose, you leave this place quietly.

00:12:21.320 --> 00:12:23.590
Hey, Lady! What do you think you're doing?

00:12:23.590 --> 00:12:26.450
It's fine, isn't it?
If you win, your job's finished.

00:12:26.450 --> 00:12:28.160
The money will be yours.

00:12:29.150 --> 00:12:30.920
Wait a damn minute! I'm not...

00:12:30.920 --> 00:12:34.000
This guy you're talking about,
his name's "Red Eye," correct?

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:37.580
If you race him, this Red Eye
guy will probably show up.

00:12:38.470 --> 00:12:39.630
You...

00:13:06.200 --> 00:13:06.780
Here you go.

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:08.660
I don't need it.

00:13:08.660 --> 00:13:09.800
Didn't think so.

00:13:11.260 --> 00:13:12.220
Me either!

00:13:13.010 --> 00:13:14.250
H-Hey!

00:13:15.080 --> 00:13:16.610
That's crazy!

00:13:19.610 --> 00:13:21.750
You... What are you up to?

00:13:21.750 --> 00:13:24.240
Don't say it like that.

00:13:24.260 --> 00:13:27.720
I'm just trying to take care of you
so you don't end up starving to death.

00:13:27.720 --> 00:13:31.140
Shit... In for a penny, in for a pound.

00:13:31.140 --> 00:13:32.770
I guess I'll stick around a little longer.

00:13:34.720 --> 00:13:37.470
Here, I probably won't be needing this.

00:13:38.350 --> 00:13:41.030
Probably not. For now, at least...

00:14:05.800 --> 00:14:07.480
How do you like that?

00:14:08.310 --> 00:14:09.430
Dammit!

00:14:12.800 --> 00:14:16.770
You're going to have a hard time
avenging your brother if you ride that slow.

00:14:18.280 --> 00:14:20.950
Shiiiit!

00:14:27.810 --> 00:14:31.320
Take that! This race is all mine!

00:14:45.620 --> 00:14:47.520
He's got nitros! Idiot!

00:15:47.630 --> 00:15:48.900
Brother!

00:15:48.900 --> 00:15:50.360
Wait! Don't go!

00:15:50.360 --> 00:15:51.970
Brother!

00:15:51.970 --> 00:15:53.020
Stop!

00:15:54.980 --> 00:15:56.450
Brother! Brother! Brother!

00:15:59.130 --> 00:16:00.740
There's no way I can stop!

00:16:01.260 --> 00:16:04.640
Not when the wind's this good!

00:16:10.430 --> 00:16:11.530
This sound, eh?

00:16:44.630 --> 00:16:48.080
What are you trying to accomplish,
going so far to follow your brother?

00:17:05.300 --> 00:17:08.430
That woman... This is what
she had planned all along.

00:17:09.390 --> 00:17:10.540
Fine then!

00:17:20.400 --> 00:17:21.350
Shit!

00:17:21.350 --> 00:17:22.420
What the hell do you think you're doing?!

00:17:23.530 --> 00:17:27.130
You called me 'cause you knew you wouldn't
be able to take this thing out, didn't you?!

00:17:27.130 --> 00:17:30.640
Well, if you already know what's going
on, why don't you just go get that guy?

00:17:30.640 --> 00:17:32.460
You make it sound like it's so easy.

00:17:32.460 --> 00:17:34.300
What's wrong? Is it too difficult for you?

00:17:34.300 --> 00:17:36.340
Nope, easy as can be!

00:18:29.690 --> 00:18:33.090
Speeding causes accidents!

00:19:41.690 --> 00:19:42.960
Brother...

00:19:44.830 --> 00:19:45.970
Brother!

00:19:47.340 --> 00:19:51.130
You had planned to use me all along.

00:19:51.130 --> 00:19:55.970
Sorry. Actually this was the real job the
Highway Department wanted to have done.

00:19:56.900 --> 00:20:00.130
You can never do things
the simple way, can you?

00:20:00.130 --> 00:20:04.300
And you can't ever simply do what I ask you.

00:20:04.300 --> 00:20:05.570
Damn straight.

00:20:08.980 --> 00:20:10.330
Brother!

00:20:16.430 --> 00:20:17.960
Brother...

00:20:24.680 --> 00:20:28.790
Brother!

00:20:38.550 --> 00:20:41.740
Even with this room put back the
way it was, I still don't see any clients.

00:20:41.740 --> 00:20:44.790
I'm all about a one-day workweek.

00:20:44.790 --> 00:20:47.750
I should be getting paid for
that recent job any day now...

00:20:48.120 --> 00:20:50.980
Recent job... You mean the
devil on the motorcycle thing?

00:20:50.980 --> 00:20:54.810
Yep. After all, I ended up
getting rid of the Highway Devil.

00:20:54.810 --> 00:20:57.050
Lady's negotiating with the
guys from the Highway Department

00:20:57.050 --> 00:20:58.790
trying get us a big wad of cash.

00:20:58.790 --> 00:20:59.970
Here we go!

00:21:02.260 --> 00:21:05.440
I was waiting to hear from
you! Oh, about my money...

00:21:06.440 --> 00:21:07.270
What?

00:21:08.530 --> 00:21:10.390
You added to my debt?

00:21:10.390 --> 00:21:14.090
Yes. We got paid for taking care of Red Eye,

00:21:14.090 --> 00:21:16.690
but there are some charges for
repairing that bridge you tore up...

00:21:16.690 --> 00:21:18.800
I'm pretty sure the bill will come to you.

00:21:18.800 --> 00:21:20.410
What? Our pay?

00:21:20.410 --> 00:21:22.850
I'll deduct it from what
you owe me, naturally.

00:21:23.360 --> 00:21:25.020
What? Just a dang minute!

00:21:25.690 --> 00:21:27.160
Shit! That woman...

00:21:29.140 --> 00:21:31.620
I guess you're just an unlucky guy.

00:21:32.110 --> 00:21:32.990
Shut up.

00:21:38.540 --> 00:21:39.470
Here you go!

00:21:40.550 --> 00:21:45.880
That woman told me that your office was here,
so I thought I'd drop by to say "thanks."

00:21:46.930 --> 00:21:48.010
Thank you.

00:21:48.870 --> 00:21:52.160
If I had kept on like I was, I'd be dead too.

00:21:52.770 --> 00:21:56.880
For some reason I thought I heard
the voice of my brother saying,

00:21:56.880 --> 00:21:58.470
"It'd be a waste for you to die."

00:21:59.760 --> 00:22:01.800
I'm done chasing the
remembrance of my brother.

00:22:02.220 --> 00:22:05.030
From here on I ride for me...

00:22:05.030 --> 00:22:05.950
And that's why I gotta ask.

00:22:07.510 --> 00:22:09.620
Would you race me one more time?

00:22:15.480 --> 00:22:16.920
Let's make a little bet.

00:22:16.920 --> 00:22:17.490
A bet?

00:22:17.960 --> 00:22:21.890
If none of the balls go in, I'll race you.

00:22:22.600 --> 00:22:25.170
But if I sink the 8-ball...

00:22:25.170 --> 00:22:26.130
Yeah?

00:22:26.850 --> 00:22:28.260
You buy me dinner.

00:24:01.630 --> 00:24:05.310
There are people out there who would say
 that there's nothing more important than love.

00:24:05.310 --> 00:24:06.830
But is love really that great?

00:24:08.120 --> 00:24:11.910
There are women who, because
of love, get chased around by men.

00:24:11.910 --> 00:24:14.650
And there are men who,
because of love, get killed by women.

00:24:15.730 --> 00:24:20.110
To boil it down, for love to be so great,

00:24:20.110 --> 00:24:22.920
there's gotta be something else
behind it that's even greater.

00:24:23.830 --> 00:24:25.680
But I'm not going to
tell you what that is.

00:24:25.680 --> 00:24:27.740
I'm not that unsophisticated.